cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the versioned release described below."
type: software
title: "CPO-STCM: Normal-only LED-animation anomaly detection with partially observed semantic consistency"
version: "1.0.0-rc.1"
date-released: 2026-11-07
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/wwlswj/CPO-STCM"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24031262"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24031262"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24031261"
    description: "Concept DOI for all versions of CPO-STCM"
abstract: >-
  CPO-STCM is research software for normal-only anomaly detection in
  LED-screen animations. It combines temporal reconstruction, partially
  observed semantic-slot consistency, and block-aware conformal calibration.
keywords:
  - anomaly detection
  - conformal prediction
  - industrial inspection
  - LED animation
  - normal-only learning
  - temporal consistency
